course: dictionary
lesson: 12782
title: A formal word: efficacious
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: Efficacious is a formal word, so you will meet it in science, medicine and exam papers. It means working well and producing the result you want. An efficacious medicine is one that really makes you better.
explain: Look for the clues around it. «The new tablets were efficacious against the infection, and the children felt better within two days.» The result wanted, feeling better, shows that efficacious means it worked.
explain: Scientists check whether a treatment is efficacious with fair tests. They compare people who take it with people who do not. A medicine that looks nice is not enough; it has to work.
fact: Efficacious means working well and producing the result you want.
fact: It is mostly used for medicines and treatments.
fact: «Highly efficacious» means it works very well.
fact: «Efficacious against» tells you what the treatment works on, as in «efficacious against colds».
fact: Efficacious is close in meaning to effective, but it is more formal.
exercise: «The bandage was efficacious, and the cut healed quickly.» What does efficacious mean here? | Very large | Painful to touch | *Working well, giving the result wanted | Bright and shiny
exercise: Which phrase means the medicine works very well? | Blue and efficacious | Loud and efficacious | Tired and efficacious | *Highly efficacious
exercise: Scientists test a new tablet to see if it is efficacious. Why do they do this? | *To find out whether it really works | To make it taste nicer | To change its colour | To make it cheaper to sell
test: «The cream was efficacious against the rash.» What is the cream good at? | Making the rash bigger | *Working well against the rash | Changing the colour of the skin | Hiding the rash from view
test: Which word is the closest in meaning to efficacious? | Barely | *Effective | Ancient | Glum
exam: Read this: «The new vaccine proved highly efficacious in fair trials.» Choose the best meaning of efficacious. | Very old and rare | Dangerous to touch | Quiet and gentle | *Working well and producing the result wanted
